Significance: minor
Type: deprecated

v1's lock, access, group-fields and value filters and dws_lpmwc_initialized and dws_lpmwc_initialization_failure fire deprecated, each before its replacement. v1's two per-method lock filters fire wherever the plugin judges a lock, at checkout only for the locked methods it offers, and v1's locked-list filter fires only at checkout, after locked_payment_methods_for_woocommerce/payment_method/locked_ids.
